OL,3,AWhat to know about Brazil's election as
OL,4,ALula and Flavio Bolsonaro face off
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazilians just finished voting in a
OL,7,Fgeneral election in which the two
OL,8,Ffront-runners for the presidency bear
OL,9,Fvery familiar names.
OL,11,FPolls closed at 17:00 Brasilia Time
OL,12,F(20:00 GMT) on Sunday, with the
OL,13,Fnation's vast electronic voter system
OL,14,Fexpected to deliver a result within a
OL,15,Ffew hours.
OL,17,FThe incumbent, veteran left-wing leader
OL,18,FLuiz Inacio Lula da Silva, is
OL,19,Fchallenged by 11 candidates, the most
OL,20,Fprominent of whom is right-winger
OL,21,FFlavio Bolsonaro.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
